WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
I heard a few words from my boss when he passed by before.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,440
Boss Lin’s store offers gifts like Emperor Xie as soon as they are in stock.

3
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:06,600
The rich people in our city often can’t buy it right away.

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,600
One is five thousand yuan

5
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:08,840
An emperor thanks five thousand

6
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,280
That’s almost a month’s salary for me.

7
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,040
And boss Lin is also kind to us.

8
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,640
How can you tell that he is a person who makes a lot of money?

9
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,680
Think again about Boss Xue who came two days ago

10
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,280
Looking at us is like looking after a nanny

11
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:26,260
Dog's eyes are looking down upon people and they come in, brother

12
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:27,180
Why are you here free?

13
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:29,260
Sit down quickly. I'll make tea. It's almost Chinese New Year.

14
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:30,420
I'm afraid I won't have much time later

15
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:31,940
So I came here in advance to wish you a happy new year.

16
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,620
Brother, you don’t mind, do you?

17
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:34,700
Look what you said

18
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,220
It’s too late for me to be happy when you wish me a happy new year.

19
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:37,580
Why would you mind?

20
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:40,120
This is a gift of tea and cigarettes

21
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:42,140
This kind of writing, brother
